<div class="row obs_template three_columns pt-5 mt-2 mb-5">
<div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column pt-2">
<h2 class="titre2"><span class="text-primary">Can we move towards a responsible AI?</span></h2>

<div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><a class="btn s_ia_responsable_magazine btn-primary" href="/en/magazines/can-we-move-towards-responsible-ai"><span class="text">Read the Magazine</span></a>&nbsp;<a class="btn s_ia_responsable_tous_les_magazines btn-secondary" href="/en/magazines"><span class="text">All our magazines</span></a></div>
</div>

<div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column pt-2">
<p class="align-middle pl-0">Artificial intelligence is part and parcel of daily life. The tech is invisible but it’s consequences are very real for everyone.<br>
This magazine helps you to better understand and explore all the issues it raises through a series of interviews with contributors who offer complementary backgrounds, experiences and reflections.</p>
</div>

